---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Appointment policy"
  description="Read Hobsonville Ultrasound’s appointment policy covering referrals, cancellations, late arrival, support people, payment and rescans."
>
  <PageIntro
    title="Appointment policy"
    eyebrow="Planning your visit"
    description="At Hobsonville Ultrasound, we value your time and ours. When you book an appointment, that time is reserved especially for you. Please read the following before your appointment."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container reading prose">
      <h2>Referral</h2>
      <p>
        Your scan requires a referral. Please send us a copy or clear photo of
        your referral before your appointment, by emailing{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} data-event="email_click">
          {site.email}
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>Cancellations and no-shows</h2>
      <p>
        Please give us at least 24 hours’ notice if you need to cancel or
        reschedule your appointment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Late cancellations and missed appointments (no-shows) may incur a $50
        missed appointment fee, which must be paid before your next appointment.
        We understand that genuine emergencies can happen and will consider
        these on a case-by-case basis.
      </p>
      <p>
        To cancel or reschedule, please call us or reply to your appointment
        confirmation text. If we are unable to answer, you may leave a
        voicemail.
      </p>
      <h2>Late arrivals</h2>
      <p>
        Please arrive on time for your appointment. Most ultrasound examinations
        take approximately 30 minutes.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are running late, please contact us as soon as possible. If you
        arrive 10 minutes or more late, we may not be able to complete your scan
        and you may need to reschedule. A missed appointment fee may apply. Late
        arrivals may also result in a shorter appointment to avoid delaying
        other patients.
      </p>
      <h2>Support person and children</h2>
      <p>
        You are welcome to bring one adult support person to your scan. For
        health, safety and privacy reasons, we prefer that children do not
        attend appointments.
      </p>
      <p>If a child must attend:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Only one child may attend.</li>
        <li>
          The child must be supervised by another adult who is not the patient.
        </li>
        <li>Children must not be left unattended in the waiting room.</li>
        <li>
          If the child becomes unsettled, the accompanying adult may be asked to
          take them outside.
        </li>
        <li>
          For longer or more detailed examinations, we strongly recommend making
          other childcare arrangements where possible.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Payment is required at the time of your scan. Any outstanding fees,
        including missed appointment fees, must be paid before further
        appointments can be provided.
      </p>
      <h2>Rescans</h2>
      <p>
        Some examinations, particularly certain pregnancy scans, require
        specific images to be obtained. Occasionally a rescan may be needed
        because of your baby’s position or movement, bladder filling or other
        factors.
      </p>
      <p>
        If a rescan is required, it will be offered subject to availability and
        within the appropriate timeframe. A rescan may incur an additional fee,
        which is the patient’s responsibility. A rescan recommendation does not
        necessarily mean there is a problem; sometimes the required views simply
        cannot be obtained during the original appointment.
      </p>
      <h2>By booking your appointment</h2>
      <p>
        By proceeding with your appointment, you acknowledge and agree to these
        policies. If you have any questions, please{' '}
        <a href={site.tel} data-event="phone_click">
          call {site.phone}
        </a>{' '}
        before your appointment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thank you for your understanding. We look forward to seeing you at
        Hobsonville Ultrasound.
      </p>
      <p class="small muted">
        Hobsonville Ultrasound, formerly Body 2 Baby Ultrasound
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
